{"id": "9th-u3-q002", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u3-panpaadu", "lesson_id": "lesson-01-eru-thazhuvuthal", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-eru-thazhuvuthal", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "சங்க இலக்கியமான கலித்தொகையில் ஏறு தழுவுதல் எவ்வகை நிலத்து மக்களின் வீர விளையாட்டாகக் குறிப்பிடப்படுகிறது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "குறிஞ்சி நிலக் குறவர்கள்", "B": "முல்லை நில ஆயர்கள்", "C": "மருத நில உழவர்கள்", "D": "நெய்தல் நிலப் பரதவர்கள்"}, "explanation": "சங்க இலக்கியமான கலித்தொகையில் முல்லைநில ஆயர்கள் பங்கேற்கும் நிகழ்வாக ஏறு தழுவுதல் குறிப்பிடப்பட்டுள்ளது. இது அவர்களின் வீரத்தை மெய்ப்பிக்கும் பண்பாட்டு நிகழ்வாகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In the Sangam anthology Kalithogai, people of which landscape are described participating in bull-embracing?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Kurinji hill hunters", "B": "Mullai pastoral cowherds (Aayars)", "C": "Marutham wetland farmers", "D": "Neithal coastal fishermen"}, "explanation": "Kalithogai depicts Eru Thazhuvuthal as the quintessential martial sport of the pastoral cowherds (Aayars) in the Mullai tract."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 50, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 50", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_3", "eru_thazhuvuthal", "sanga_ilakkiyam"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u3-q003", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u3-panpaadu", "lesson_id": "lesson-01-eru-thazhuvuthal", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-eru-thazhuvuthal", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'நீறு எடுப்பவை, நிலம் சாடுபவை / மாறுஏற்றுச் சிலைப்பவையாய், மண்டிப் பாய் பவையாய்' - என்று காளைகளின் பாய்ச்சலை விவரிக்கும் நூல் எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "நற்றிணை", "B": "குறுந்தொகை", "C": "கலித்தொகை (பாடல் 106)", "D": "அகநானூறு"}, "explanation": "கலித்தொகை 106-ஆம் பாடலில் (அடி 7-10) காளைகள் புழுதியைக் கிளறி, நிலத்தைச் சாடி, எதிர்த்து முழங்கிப் பாயும் காட்சியை விவரிக்கிறது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which Sangam classic describes the fierce charge of bulls with 'Neeru eduppavai, nilam saadubavai, maaruetruch silaippavaiyaai, mandip paaybavaiyaai'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Natrinai", "B": "Kurunthogai", "C": "Kalithogai (Verse 106)", "D": "Agananuru"}, "explanation": "Kalithogai hymn 106 captures how bulls kick up ash/dust, gore the ground, bellow defiance, and lunge forward with knees bent."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "202