{"id": "9th-u3-q004", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u3-panpaadu", "lesson_id": "lesson-01-eru-thazhuvuthal", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-eru-thazhuvuthal", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கலித்தொகை தவிர, பண்டைய இலக்கியங்களில் ஏறு தழுவுதல் (ஏறுகோள்) பற்றிக் கூறும் இலக்கண நூல் எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "தொல்காப்பியம்", "B": "நன்னூல்", "C": "யாப்பருங்கலக்காரிகை", "D": "புறப்பொருள் வெண்பாமாலை"}, "explanation": "கலித்தொகை தவிர, சிலப்பதிகாரம் முதலான இலக்கியங்களிலும் 'புறப்பொருள் வெண்பாமாலை' என்னும் இலக்கண நூலிலும் 'ஏறுகோள்' குறித்துக் கூறப்பட்டுள்ளது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Besides Kalithogai and Silappadikaram, which ancient grammatical treatise mentions 'Erugol' (bull capture)?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Tholkappiyam", "B": "Nannool", "C": "Yaapparungalakkaarigai", "D": "Purapporul Venbaamaalai"}, "explanation": "Purapporul Venbaamaalai, the foundational treatise on exterior warfare and valorous deeds, explicitly codifies 'Erugol'."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 51, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 51", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_3", "eru_thazhuvuthal", "sanga_ilakkiyam"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u3-q005", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u3-panpaadu", "lesson_id": "lesson-01-eru-thazhuvuthal", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-eru-thazhuvuthal", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'எருதுகட்டி' என்னும் மாடு தழுவுதல் நிகழ்வைப் பதிவு செய்துள்ள பிற்காலச் சிற்றிலக்கியம் எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "கண்ணுடையம்மன் பள்ளு", "B": "முக்கூடற்பள்ளு", "C": "திருக்குற்றாலக் குறவஞ்சி", "D": "மதுரை மீனாட்சியம்மை பிள்ளைத்தமிழ்"}, "explanation": "ஏறு தழுவுதல் பற்றிப் பிற்காலச் சிற்றிலக்கியங்களுள் ஒன்றான பள்ளு இலக்கியத்திலும் குறிப்புகள் உள்ளன. 'எருதுகட்டி' என்னும் மாடு தழுவுதல் நிகழ்வைக் 'கண்ணுடையம்மன் பள்ளு' பதிவு செய்துள்ளது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which later Pallu minor literature recorded the bull-embracing event under the name 'Erudhukatti'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Kannudaiyamman Pallu", "B": "Mukkoodarpallu", "C": "Thirukutralak Kuravanji", "D": "Madurai Meenakshiammai Pillaithamizh"}, "explanation": "Kannudaiyamman Pallu, an agrarian folk literature work, documents the pastoral tradition of bull taming under the term 'Erudhukatti'."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corpo