{"id": "9th-u3-q012", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u3-panpaadu", "lesson_id": "lesson-01-eru-thazhuvuthal", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-eru-thazhuvuthal", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'துளங்கு இமில் நல்ஏற்றினம்' - இதில் 'இமில்' என்பது காளையின் எந்த உறுப்பைக் குறிக்கும்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "குளம்பு", "B": "கழுத்து", "C": "செவி", "D": "திமில் (Hump)"}, "explanation": "சொல்லும் பொருள்: 'இமில்' என்பது காளையின் முதுகில் உயர்ந்து நிற்கும் 'திமில்' (Hump) ஆகும். தமிழ்க் காளைகளின் தனித்துவ அடையாளமே இத்திமில் ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In 'Thulangu imil nal-aetrinam', what anatomical part of the bull does 'Imil' represent?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Hoof", "B": "Neck dewlap", "C": "Ear", "D": "Hump (Thimil)"}, "explanation": "'Imil' is the classical Tamil term for the muscular dorsal hump of the Indian zebu bull."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 51, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 51", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous