{"id": "9th-u3-q042", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u3-panpaadu", "lesson_id": "lesson-01-eru-thazhuvuthal", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-eru-thazhuvuthal", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "ஏறு தழுவுதல் நிகழ்வின் தொடக்கத்திலும் முடிவிலும் தமிழர்கள் எதற்கு வழிபாடு செய்வர்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "ஆயுதங்களுக்கு", "B": "காளைகளுக்கு", "C": "மன்னரின் சிம்மாசனத்திற்கு", "D": "வாகனங்களுக்கு"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் கூற்று: 'நிகழ்வின் தொடக்கத்திலும் முடிவிலும் காளைகளுக்கு வழிபாடு செய்வர்.' இது விலங்குகளை முன்னிலைப்படுத்தும் தமிழர் பண்பாடாகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "At both the commencement and conclusion of Eru Thazhuvuthal, to what do Tamils perform reverence and ritual worship?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Weapons of warfare", "B": "The bulls", "C": "The royal throne", "D": "Transport vehicles"}, "explanation": "At the start and finish of the event, prayers and worship are reverently offered directly to the bulls."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 53, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9