{"id": "9th-u3-q077", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u3-panpaadu", "lesson_id": "lesson-02-manimekalai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-manimekalai", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'காய்க்குலைக் கமுகு', 'பூகொடிவல்லி', 'முத்துத்தாமம்' - ஆகியவற்றின் இலக்கணக்குறிப்பு யாது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "இரண்டாம் வேற்றுமை உருபும் பயனும் உடன் தொக்க தொகைகள்", "B": "மூன்றாம் வேற்றுமைத் தொகைகள்", "C": "நான்காம் வேற்றுமைத் தொகைகள்", "D": "வினைத்தொகைகள்"}, "explanation": "காயைக் கொண்ட குலை = காய்க்குலை (இரண்டாம் வேற்றுமை உருபும் பயனும் உடன் தொக்க தொகை); முத்தை உடைய தாமம் = முத்துத்தாமம். இவ்வாறே பூங்கொடிவல்லியும் அமையும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What is the grammatical classification of 'Kaaykkulaik Kamugu' and 'Muthutthaamam'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Compounds with dropped second case marker and associated meaning (Irandaam vaetrumai urubum payanum udan thokka thogaigal)", "B": "Third case compounds", "C": "Fourth case compounds", "D": "Verbal compounds"}, "explanation": "Both compounds elide the accusative case suffix '-ai' alongside the derived semantic verb ('having/bearing'), classifying them as Irandaam vaetrumai urubum payanum udanthokka thogai."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "boo