t 1, Page 56", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_3", "manimekalai", "seethalai_saathanaar"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u3-q079", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u3-panpaadu", "lesson_id": "lesson-02-manimekalai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-manimekalai", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தமிழ் மக்களின் வாழ்வியலைச் சொல்லும் கருவூலங்களாகவும் தொடர்நிலைச் செய்யுள் வரிசையில் 'இரட்டைக் காப்பியங்கள்' எனவும் போற்றப்படும் நூல்கள் எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "சீவக சிந்தாமணி, வளையாபதி", "B": "குண்டலகேசி, நீலகேசி", "C": "சிலப்பதிகாரம், மணிமேகலை", "D": "கம்பராமாயணம், பெரியபுராணம்"}, "explanation": "சிலப்பதிகாரமும் மணிமேகலையும் கதையமைப்பிலும் பாத்திர அமைப்பிலும் காலத்திலும் ஒன்றுடன் ஒன்று தொடர்புடையதால் 'இரட்டைக் காப்பியங்கள்' என அழைக்கப்படுகின்றன."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which two epic masterpieces are acclaimed as the 'Twin Epics' (Irattaik Kaappiyangal) of Tamil literature?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Seevaga Chinthamani and Valayapathi", "B": "Kundalakesi and Neelakesi", "C": "Silappadikaram and Manimekalai", "D": "Kamba Ramayanam and Periyapuranam"}, "explanation": "Silappadikaram and Manimekalai share continuous narrative threads and social context, earning the status of 'Twin Epics'."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbo