{"id": "9th-u3-q082", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u3-panpaadu", "lesson_id": "lesson-02-manimekalai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-manimekalai", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கதை அமைப்பின் அடிப்படையில் மணிமேகலை எந்த நூலின் தொடர்ச்சியாகக் கருதப்படுகிறது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "சீவக சிந்தாமணி", "B": "சிலப்பதிகாரம்", "C": "பெரியபுராணம்", "D": "பட்டிமண்டபக் காவியம்"}, "explanation": "சிலப்பதிகாரத்தில் கோவலன்-கண்ணகி கதை முடிகிறது; கோவலன்-மாதவிக்கு மகளாகப் பிறந்த மணிமேகலையின் வாழ்வை உரைப்பதால் இது சிலப்பதிகாரத்தின் தொடர்ச்சியாகக் கருதப்படுகிறது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Narratively, Manimekalai functions as the direct chronological sequel to which master epic?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Seevaga Chinthamani", "B": "Silappadikaram", "C": "Periyapuranam", "D": "Pattimandapa Kaaviyam"}, "explanation": "Picking up after the Madurai catastrophe, Manimekalai follows the destiny of Kovalan and Madhavi's daughter as a direct sequel to Silappadikaram."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 56, "chapter": null, "