{"id": "9th-u3-q087", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u3-panpaadu", "lesson_id": "lesson-03-thiruppavai-thiruvempavai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-thiruppavai-thiruvempavai", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "இறைவனுக்கு அணிவிக்க வேண்டிய மலர் மாலையைத் தாம் சூடிக் கண்ணாடியில் கண்டு பின் இறைவனுக்கு அளித்ததால் ஆண்டாளுக்கு வழங்கப்பட்ட திருநாமம் யாது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "கொடிவல்லி", "B": "பூங்கோதை", "C": "சூடிக்கொடுத்த சுடர்க்கொடி", "D": "நாச்சியார்"}, "explanation": "ஆண்டாள் பெருமாளுக்குச் சாத்த வேண்டிய மாலையைத் தன் கூந்தலில் சூடிக் அழகு பார்த்துப் பின்னர் அளித்ததால் 'சூடிக்கொடுத்த சுடர்க்கொடி' எனப் போற்றப்படுகிறார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Because she wore the consecrated flower garlands herself before offering them to the deity, what revered title was conferred on Andal?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Kodivalli", "B": "Poongodhai", "C": "Soodikkoduttha Sudarkkodi (The radiant vine who gave what she adorned)", "D": "Nachiyar"}, "explanation": "Andal is lovingly hailed as 'Soodikkoduttha Sudarkkodi' because she affectionately tried on the garland before offering it to Lord Ranganatha."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil N