{"id": "9th-u3-q089", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u3-panpaadu", "lesson_id": "lesson-03-thiruppavai-thiruvempavai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-thiruppavai-thiruvempavai", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'கீசுகீ சென்று எங்கும் ஆனைச்சாத்தன் கலந்து பேசின பேச்சரவம் கேட்டிலையோ?' - இதில் 'ஆனைச்சாத்தன்' என்பதன் பொருள் யாது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "கரிக்குருவி / கீச்சாங்குருவி (வலியன்)", "B": "யானைப்பாகன்", "C": "அரண்மனைக் காவலன்", "D": "குயில் பறவை"}, "explanation": "சொல்லும் பொருளும்: 'ஆனைச்சாத்தன்' என்பது காலையில் கீசுகீசு என்று கூவும் 'கரிக்குருவி' (கீச்சாங்குருவி / வலியன்) என்னும் பறவையைக் குறிக்கும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In Thiruppavai verse 7, what bird species does 'Aanaichathan' denote in 'Keesukeesu endrengum aanaichathan kalandhu'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Black drongo / rufous babbler (Karis-kuruvi / Keechangkuruvi)", "B": "Elephant mahout", "C": "Palace sentry", "D": "Koel bird"}, "explanation": "'Aanaichathan' refers to the noisy black drongo or babbler bird chattering vigorously at early daybreak."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9"