{"id": "9th-u3-q116", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u3-panpaadu", "lesson_id": "lesson-04-thodar-aagupeyar", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-thodar-aagupeyar", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'விளையாடுபவன் யார்?' - இத்தொடரில் 'யார்' என்னும் வினாச்சொல் பயனிலையாக வந்துள்ளதால் இது எவ்வகைப் பயனிலை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "பெயர்ப் பயனிலை", "B": "வினைப் பயனிலை", "C": "தோன்றாப் பயனிலை", "D": "வினாப் பயனிலை"}, "explanation": "ஒரு தொடரில் வினாச்சொல் பயனிலையாக வந்து முடிவது 'வினாப் பயனிலை' எனப்படும். (எ.கா. விளையாடுபவன் யார்?)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In 'Vilaiyaadubavan yaar?' (Who is the player?), the interrogative pronoun 'yaar' acts as predicate. What is it termed?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Nominal predicate", "B": "Verbal predicate", "C": "Implied predicate", "D": "Vinaap Payanilai (Interrogative predicate)"}, "explanation": "When an interrogative word concludes the sentence as its predicate, it is classified as Vinaap Payanilai."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 64, "chapter": null, "section": null, "