{"id": "9th-u3-q118", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u3-panpaadu", "lesson_id": "lesson-04-thodar-aagupeyar", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-thodar-aagupeyar", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'மல்லிகை சூடினாள்' - இதில் மல்லிகை என்னும் முதற்பொருள் (முழுக்கொடி) அதன் உறுப்பாகிய மலருக்கு ஆகிவந்ததால் இது எவ்வகை ஆகுபெயர்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "சினையாகுபெயர்", "B": "பொருளாகுபெயர் (முதலாகுபெயர்)", "C": "காலவாகுபெயர்", "D": "பண்பாகுபெயர்"}, "explanation": "முதற்பொருளாகிய மல்லிகைக் கொடியின் பெயர் அதன் சினையாகிய மலருக்கு ஆகிவந்ததால் இது 'பொருளாகுபெயர்' அல்லது 'முதலாகுபெயர்' ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In 'Malligai soodinaal' (She wore jasmine), the primary plant name stands for its flower. What metonymy is this?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Part-to-whole metonymy", "B": "Porulaagupeyar / Mudhalaagupeyar (Whole-to-part metonymy)", "C": "Temporal metonymy", "D": "Qualitative metonymy"}, "explanation": "When the name of the complete entity/plant signifies its specific anatomical part or flower, it is Porulaagupeyar."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "fu