{"id": "9th-u3-q119", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u3-panpaadu", "lesson_id": "lesson-04-thodar-aagupeyar", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-thodar-aagupeyar", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'கலாம் சாட் கண்டுபிடித்த பள்ளி மாணவனை ஊரே பாராட்டியது' - இதில் 'ஊர்' என்பது எவ்வகை ஆகுபெயர்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "பொருளாகுபெயர்", "B": "சினையாகுபெயர்", "C": "இடவாகுபெயர்", "D": "தொழிலாகுபெயர்"}, "explanation": "'ஊர் பாராட்டியது' என்பதில் ஊர் என்னும் இடப்பெயர் அவ்வூரில் வாழும் மக்களுக்கு ஆகிவந்ததால் இது 'இடவாகுபெயர்' ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In 'The town praised the student who designed KalamSat', what metonymy is 'Oor' (Town)?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Whole-for-part metonymy", "B": "Part-for-whole metonymy", "C": "Idavaagupeyar (Spatial / locational metonymy)", "D": "Action metonymy"}, "explanation": "Here the geographical place name 'Oor' stands metonymically for the human inhabitants residing there."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 65, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Un