{"id": "9th-u3-q142", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u3-panpaadu", "lesson_id": "lesson-05-thirukkural-pyq", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-thirukkural-pyq", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'செல்வத்துள் செல்வம் செவிச்செல்வம் அச்செல்வம் / செல்வத்துள் எல்லாம் தலை' - இக்குறளில் பயின்று வந்துள்ள அணி யாது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "பொருள் பின்வருநிலையணி", "B": "சொற்பொருள் பின்வருநிலையணி", "C": "ஏகதேச உருவக அணி", "D": "வஞ்சப்புகழ்ச்சியணி"}, "explanation": "'செல்வம்' என்னும் சொல் பலமுறை வந்து, அச்செல்வம் என்ற ஒரே பொருளைத் தருவதால் இது 'சொற்பொருள் பின்வருநிலையணி' ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What poetic figure of speech occurs in 'Selvatthul selvam sevichelvam achchelvam selvatthul ellaam thalai'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Porul Pinvarunilaiyani", "B": "Sorporul Pinvarunilaiyani (Repetition of word with identical meaning)", "C": "Egadhesa Uruvaga Ani", "D": "Vanchappugazhchiyani"}, "explanation": "The term 'Selvam' repeats multiple times throughout the couplet bearing the identical meaning of 'wealth', exemplifying Sorporul Pinvarunilaiyani."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corpora