{"id": "9th-u3-q143", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u3-panpaadu", "lesson_id": "lesson-05-thirukkural-pyq", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-thirukkural-pyq", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'பெருமைக்கும் ஏனைச் சிறுமைக்கும் தத்தம் / கருமமே கட்டளைக் கல்' - இக்குறட்பாவில் இடம்பெற்றுள்ள அணி எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "உவமையணி", "B": "சொல் பின்வருநிலையணி", "C": "ஏகதேச உருவக அணி", "D": "பிறிது மொழிதல் அணி"}, "explanation": "செயல்களைப் பொன்னின் தரத்தை அறியும் உரைகல்லாக உருவகம் செய்த வள்ளுவர், பெருமையையும் சிறுமையையும் பொன்னாக உருவகம் செய்யாமல் விட்டதால் இது 'ஏகதேச உருவக அணி' ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which poetic device is found in 'Perumaikkum aenaic chirumaikkum thattham karumamae kattalaik kal'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Uvamaiyani", "B": "Sol Pinvarunilaiyani", "C": "Egadhesa Uruvaga Ani (Partial / one-sided metaphor)", "D": "Piridhu Mozhidhal Ani"}, "explanation": "While human deeds are explicitly metaphorized as a jeweler's touchstone ('kattalaik kal'), virtue and vice are left un-metaphorized, constituting Egadhesa Uruvagam."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation"