{"id": "9th-u3-q160", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u3-panpaadu", "lesson_id": "lesson-05-thirukkural-pyq", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-thirukkural-pyq", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "[TNPSC PYQ] திருக்குறளுக்கு உரை எழுதிய பழைய பதின்மருள் யாருடைய உரை மிகச் சிறந்த உரையாகத் தமிழறிஞர்களால் ஒருமனதாகப் போற்றப்படுகிறது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "மணக்குடவர் உரை", "B": "தாமத்தர் உரை", "C": "நச்சர் உரை", "D": "பரிமேலழகர் உரை"}, "explanation": "திருக்குறளுக்குப் பழங்காலத்தில் தருமர், மணக்குடவர், தாமத்தர், நச்சர், பரிதி, பரிமேலழகர் உள்ளிட்ட பதின்மர் உரை எழுதினர். இவர்களுள் பரிமேலழகரின் உரையே தலைசிறந்ததாகப் போற்றப்படுகிறது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "[TNPSC PYQ] Among the ten ancient commentators of Thirukkural, whose commentary is universally acknowledged as the supreme masterpiece?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Manakkudavar commentary", "B": "Dhamatthar commentary", "C": "Nachar commentary", "D": "Parimelazhagar commentary"}, "explanation": "Parimelazhagar's commentary is celebrated for profound grammatical erudition and philosophical depth."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation"