{"id": "9th-u3-q162", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u3-panpaadu", "lesson_id": "lesson-05-thirukkural-pyq", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-thirukkural-pyq", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பாடநூல் மொழியை ஆள்வோம் வினா: 'பொருந்தாத சொல்லைக் கண்டறிக: கர்நாடகம், கேரளா, இலங்கை, ஆந்திரா'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "கர்நாடகம்", "B": "இலங்கை", "C": "கேரளா", "D": "ஆந்திரா"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக்க எண் 70: கர்நாடகம், கேரளா, ஆந்திரா என்பவை இந்திய மாநிலங்கள்; 'இலங்கை' என்பது தனி தீவு நாடாகும். எனவே இலங்கை பொருந்தாதது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Textbook Exercise: Identify the odd word out: Karnataka, Kerala, Sri Lanka, Andhra Pradesh?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Karnataka", "B": "Sri Lanka", "C": "Kerala", "D": "Andhra Pradesh"}, "explanation": "Karnataka, Kerala, and Andhra Pradesh are constituent Indian states, whereas Sri Lanka is a sovereign island nation."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 70, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 70", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "p