{"id": "9th-u3-q166", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u3-panpaadu", "lesson_id": "lesson-05-thirukkural-pyq", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-thirukkural-pyq", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "[TNPSC PYQ] திருக்குறளில் அறத்துப்பால், பொருட்பால், காமத்துப்பால் ஆகியவற்றில் முறையே உள்ள அதிகாரங்களின் எண்ணிக்கை யாது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "30, 70, 33", "B": "38, 70, 25", "C": "34, 74, 25", "D": "40, 68, 25"}, "explanation": "திருக்குறளின் முப்பாலில் உள்ள அதிகாரங்கள்: அறத்துப்பால் - 38 அதிகாரங்கள்; பொருட்பால் - 70 அதிகாரங்கள்; காமத்துப்பால் - 25 அதிகாரங்கள். மொத்தம் 133 அதிகாரங்கள் (1330 குறள்கள்)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "[TNPSC PYQ] What is the exact distribution of chapters across the three books of Thirukkural: Aram, Porul, and Inbam?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "30, 70, 33", "B": "38, 70, 25", "C": "34, 74, 25", "D": "40, 68, 25"}, "explanation": "Aratthuppal contains 38 chapters, Porutpal 70 chapters, and Kamathuppal 25 chapters, totaling 133."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 76, "chapter": null, "secti